# Black (45410083), FIRST RUN: no Black profile on the disk. DRAFT, not yet
# played: written from pass 1's frames (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-black,
# Thor, 2026-09-26), which show:
#
#   ~50 s "PRESS START"; START -> an opening-credits FMV of about 2.5 min
#   that neither START nor A skipped; then a profile-name keyboard with the
#   name KELLAR J. filled in and the cursor on DONE.
#
# Pass 1's play pattern pushed the stick and pressed A there, which typed
# letters (KELLAR J. 1K UAA1AK...). The right input is A once, on DONE,
# without touching the stick. What follows DONE was never seen, so from
# `mark profile-saved` on this route surveys and never marks gameplay.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 30
mark booted
press START
wait 5
shot credits
wait 60
shot credits60
wait 60
shot credits120
wait 40
shot keyboard
press A
wait 6
shot after-done
mark profile-saved
repeat 8 {
    press A
    wait 6
    shot after-save
}
mark play
repeat forever {
    repeat 2 {
        axis LY min
        press A
        wait 3
        axis LY mid
        wait 3
    }
    shot play
}
